{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rtNCG9Duyx1794976029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今集《技術尋寶》目標是穩中求勝股。</p><p></p><p>股評人盧駿匡指出，內銀股跑贏恒指及處於中長線上升趨勢，其股息率高亦有「穩」特質。他以工商銀行為例子，訂定買入、目標及止蝕位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:05:49.742155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:01.002270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:59:08.148887+00:00","content_hash":"ba4972be00bb1485576dbbcfcbd2c509484f72cc6d0aea5d044ee6e2834a1b9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}